| `xt/src/build.rs` | Modify | ~2 |
| `xt/src/testing.rs` | Modify | ~2 |
| `xt/tests/tspec_test.rs` | Modify | ~2 |
| `apps/*/tspec.toml` | Rename | 3 files |
| Documentation | Update | ~20 |

**Total: ~270 new lines + ~50 modified lines + 3 file renames**

---

## Verification

### Test Part A (rename)
```bash
